<tr>\n<th style=\"width:15%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E7%A2%B4\" title=\"角色图鉴库/冰碴\"><img alt=\"头像 冰碴.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/db/17jsp9t82biqa468prbgc3eeqdb19rl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">冰碴</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色绰号\n</th>\n<td>熊爹\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配置推荐\n</th>\n<td>同下\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色攻略\n</th>\n<td>【by Azhar-_-】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4SDB6Ehu\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4SDB6Ehu</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:left\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">中文CV\n</th>\n<td>杨富禄\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">日文CV\n</th>\n<td>八代拓\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">配音展示\n</th>\n<td>【by ThAmeReborn】<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://m.bilibili.com/video/BV1A19MBAE1W\">https://m.bilibili.com/video/BV1A19MBAE1W</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 75px;\">角色生平\n</th>\n<td>蛮熊部落最卑微的凡血者芬恩，也是冰原统一的奠基者之一。身边总是跟着一头身手矫捷的冰原狼，名为冰碴。<br />\n<p>无父无母，变身时灵时不灵，在部落中饱受冷眼。渴望成为战士而不得的芬恩，与冰碴相依为命，它曾是他唯一的战斗伙伴——直到他在北寻之路上遇见了伊凡与阿加塔。<br />\n他世故功利，相信唯有功名和地位才能换来部落的另眼相看，最初加入北寻，不过是一场精明的算计。然而，风雪中的生死与共，却让这份算计逐渐为信任所消融。他看似随时会逃跑，却也会在危险降临时，毫不犹豫地用身体为同伴挡住呼啸的风雪……<br />\n一个曾被所有人看轻的人，能否最终证明——能定义战士的，从来不是血统，而是他所捍卫的信念？\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>角色像素模型\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%8A%AC%E6%81%A9_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"芬恩 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/48/of52usm3x5nt5w47090jmrpfsgcq51g.png/100px-%E8%8A%AC%E6%81%A9_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/48/of52usm3x5nt5w47090jmrpfsgcq51g.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022141001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.276 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.443 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1799/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51079/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5106/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 399/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  303.667      1 -total\n100.00%  303.667      1 模板:角色\n 56.95%  172.941      1 模板:技能树\n 47.53%  144.329     14 模板:技能图\n  4.76%   14.447      1 模板:面包屑\n  4.28%   12.993      1 模板:个性图\n  4.16%   12.640      1 模板:极限解放图\n  1.73%    5.240      1 模板:立绘\n  1.44%    4.387      1 模板:兵种图\n  0.97%    2.953      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8341-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022141001 and revision id 20857. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"角色","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"可邂逅角色","missing":true}],"images":["立绘_芬